<title>FRANCE: Pinault-Printemps Q1 sales rise 5.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Pinault-Printemps Q1 sales rise 5.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three months to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					20,248    vs   19,123</p>
<p>NOTE - Pinault-Printemps-Redoute reported its first-quarter sales in the official bulletin BALO. It said they rose 5.9 percent.</p>
<p>Sales at its Rexel subsidiary, also reported in the BALO, totalled 6,507 million francs in the first quarter, compared with 5,675 million in the year-earlier quarter.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
